Package: McnemarControl
Type: Package
Title: McNemar tests for a Control against multiple Treatments
Version: 0.1.6
Authors@R: person(given = "Peter", family = "Ho", role = c("aut", "cre","cph"), email = "p.ho@leeds.ac.uk",
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2533-0183"))
Description: Convenience functions to run McNemar tests comparing a control condition
    with one or more treatment conditions from long-format paired binary data, using
    mostly functions from contingencytables package. Includes effect size estimates and
    confidence intervals, adjustments to confidence intervals and p-values and sample
    size and power calculations.
